; The engine exposes one global native-use callback. The z-prefixed filename is
; intentional: DLTX applies mod_game_global_*.ltx patches by filename, and this
; patch must run after the installed pf_stash_qa bridge.
;
; pf_npc_editor handles its own reusable QA tool and forwards every other item
; to pf_stash_qa/lz_new_mechanics from Lua.
![callbacks]
; The installed zz_lz-new-mechanics layer declares a missing
; lz_new_mechanics.actor_before_hit. Register an addon-owned pass-through
; functor instead of relying on DLTX property deletion: CActor::Hit always
; resolves this symbol, while returning true preserves stock hit processing.
OnBeforeHit = pf_npc_editor.on_before_hit_passthrough
OnInventoryEat = pf_npc_editor.on_inventory_eat
